# Generated by tools/spheres_prestige.py; the knightknight archetype requirement and per-round magecap use remain sheet-resolved.
Magemage Aligned Class	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:Starting at 1st level, the magemage gains all the class features she would otherwise gain as a mageknight, essentially adding every magemage level to her mageknight level to determine what class features she gains and the effects of her mageknight class abilities. She still retains the Hit Dice, base attack bonus, saving throw bonuses, and skill ranks of the prestige class, but gains all other mageknight class features as well as those of the magemage prestige class.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc6
Magemage Casting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:A magemage may combine spheres and talents to create magical effects. A magemage is considered a Low-Caster. (Note: All casters gain 2 bonus talents and a casting tradition the first time they gain the casting class feature.)	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc3	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_LOW_CASTER|1
Magemage Don Robes and Magecap	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:At 1st level, the magemage may use their practitioner modifier instead of the casting ability modifier associated with their casting tradition. In addition, the magemage gains Advanced Magic Training as a bonus feat. If the magemage already possesses Advanced Magic Training, she instead gains Extra Magic Talent.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc7
Magemage Sagacity	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:At 2nd level, the magemage’s new policy of learning, and even sometimes reading, before slaying her foes has given her a new outlook on magic. She gains a bonus on all Spellcraft checks equal to 2 + half her magemage level.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc8	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_SAGACITY_BONUS|max(1,INT)
Magemage Spellwrought Mark	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:At 3rd level, when the magemage uses her knightknight mark of justice ability, the target suffers a -2 penalty to saving throws against the spells, spell-like abilities, and sphere abilities of the magemage, and the magemage gains a +2 bonus to saving throws against the spells, spell-like abilities, and sphere abilities of the target.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc9	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_SPELLWROUGHT_DIE|floor(SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_LEVEL/2)
Magemage Knowledge Is My Sword	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:At 4th level, the magemage learns to leverage her power to her needs. Each day when the magemage regains spell points, she chooses one magic sphere she possesses. Until the magemage rests and regains spell points again, she gains a bonus to her caster level equal to her magemage level when using that sphere. This bonus cannot increase the magemage’s caster level with that sphere above her Hit Dice.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc10	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_KNOWLEDGE_SWORD_BONUS|floor(SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_LEVEL/2)
Magemage Wisdom Is My Orb	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:At 6th level, the magemage gains a circumstance bonus on all concentration checks equal to half her magemage level.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc11	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_WISDOM_ORB_BONUS|floor(SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_LEVEL/2)
Magemage Might Is My Scepter	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:At 8th level, as long as the magemage has a point of gallantry, her resist magic mageknight ability applies to all saving throws the magemage makes, not just saving throws against spells, spell-like abilities, and magic sphere effects.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc12	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_MIGHT_SCEPTER_BONUS|floor(SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_LEVEL/2)
Magemage Magic Is My Crown	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:MagemageClassFeature	DESC:At 10th level, the magemage may treat her weapon as an implement for the sphere selected with knowledge is my sword. The implement’s effective enhancement bonus is equal to the weapon’s enhancement bonus (maximum +5).	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magemage#toc13	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGEMAGE_CROWN_CL_BONUS|2
